    {
      "id": 22,
      "title": "What it costs",
      "description": "How much Candor leans on the AI, and how often it avoids doing so. Token counts are not recorded yet, so calls are the closest measure.",
      "type": "row",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "AI calls avoided (24h)",
      "description": "Of the findings Candor could have sent to the AI in the last 24h, the share it did not, because nothing had changed, it was suppressed, or a budget was reached. Findings skipped only because no AI is configured are left out. This counts calls, not tokens or money.",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19,
        "w": 5,
        "h": 6
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.5
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "text": {
          "valueSize": 34
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(candor_enrichment_skipped_total{reason!=\"no_llm_configured\"}[24h])) / (sum(increase(candor_enrichment_skipped_total{reason!=\"no_llm_configured\"}[24h])) + sum(increase(candor_llm_calls_total[24h])))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "title": "Estimated tokens avoided (24h)",
      "description": "An estimate, not a measurement. AI calls avoided in the last 24h multiplied by the average tokens per real AI call over the same period (candor_enrichment_skipped_total, candor_llm_tokens_total and candor_llm_calls_total). Shows no value until there has been at least one real call to average. No price is configured, so this is tokens, not money.",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 5,
        "y": 19,
        "w": 5,
        "h": 6
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "Not enough data yet",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "wideLayout": false,
        "text": {
          "valueSize": 34
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "expr": "sum(increase(candor_enrichment_skipped_total{reason!=\"no_llm_configured\"}[24h])) * (sum(increase(candor_llm_tokens_total[24h])) / sum(increase(candor_llm_calls_total{result=\"success\"}[24h])))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "AI budget used per policy",
